  "item_short_desc": "<p>From fly fishing to a weekend getaway in the mountains, our Uncle Milty Travel Vest is a must-have for your outdoor wardrobe. With 17 utility pockets that offer plenty of storage for gear and equipment, this rugged vest is great for fishermen, outdoor enthusiasts, photographers, and more.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "7709",
  "description": "<p>From fly fishing to a weekend getaway in the mountains, our Uncle Milty Travel Vest is a must-have for your outdoor wardrobe. With 17 utility pockets that offer plenty of storage for gear and equipment, this rugged vest is great for fishermen, outdoor enthusiasts, photographers, and more. Multiple Storage Pockets: The fishing vest features 13 front organizer pockets designed to comfortably carry outdoor gear, such as several multitools, fishing lures, and camera equipment. Keep your cellphone, wallet, and other everyday carry essentials safe and secure within the 3 interior pockets. Additionally, the expandable cargo zipper pocket on the back is perfect for holding gloves, rags, and other bulky items. Utility at the Forefront: Attach even more survival accessories and camping supplies to the outdoor vest with the 3 d-rings. We also incorporated a detachable fly patch for keeping your favorite flies close by as you fly fish. For those who are constantly on the move, secure your travel vest into place with the belt loop and front button-snap zipper closure. Unparalleled Durability: Each hiking vest is crafted with a long-lasting 55% cotton / 45% polyester fabric for a lightweight and comfortable fit. This blend provides unmatched resiliency and easy-to-care-for maintenance (machine washable). These photographer vests are not afraid to get down and dirty out in the wilderness. Travel the Great Outdoors: Whether you are gearing up for the airport or heading out to the bait &amp; tackle shop, this versatile vest is the ultimate travel companion. Our Uncle Milty Vest is the perfect choice for traveling, fishing, hunting, camping, hiking, outdoor sports, daily use, and more.</p>",
